sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Editor A
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant WS as WebSocket
  participant B as Editor B
  A->>API: PUT tema If-Match revision 4
  API->>DB: validar y actualizar revision 5
  DB-->>API: commit
  API->>WS: FLUTTER_THEME_UPDATED revision 5
  WS-->>B: evento confirmado
  alt B sin borrador
    B->>API: GET tema
  else B con borrador
    B->>B: conservar y mostrar conflicto
  end
